{"id":"pemrograman/css/semantic-ui/06.-formulir-dan-validasi-otomatis","title":"06. Formulir dan Validasi Otomatis","slug":"06. formulir dan validasi otomatis","relativePath":"Pemrograman/CSS/Semantic UI/06. Formulir dan Validasi Otomatis.md","folder":"Pemrograman/CSS/Semantic UI","frontmatter":{"tags":[],"aliases":[]},"tags":["programming"],"aliases":[],"headings":[{"depth":2,"text":"1. Anatomi Dasar Formulir (`ui form`)","id":"1-anatomi-dasar-formulir-ui-form"},{"depth":2,"text":"2. Pengelompokan Kolom Input (`fields`)","id":"2-pengelompokan-kolom-input-fields"},{"depth":3,"text":"A. Pembagian Berdasarkan Kata Jumlah (`two fields`, `three fields`)","id":"a-pembagian-berdasarkan-kata-jumlah-two-fields-three-fields"},{"depth":3,"text":"B. Pembagian Kolom Bebas Rata (`equal width fields`)","id":"b-pembagian-kolom-bebas-rata-equal-width-fields"},{"depth":2,"text":"3. Variasi Input: Ikon, Label, dan Tombol Gandeng","id":"3-variasi-input-ikon-label-dan-tombol-gandeng"},{"depth":2,"text":"4. Modul Validasi Formulir Otomatis Bawaan","id":"4-modul-validasi-formulir-otomatis-bawaan"},{"depth":3,"text":"Markup HTML Form dengan Wadah Error","id":"markup-html-form-dengan-wadah-error"},{"depth":3,"text":"Konfigurasi JavaScript Validasi","id":"konfigurasi-javascript-validasi"}],"content":"#programming \n\nFormulir di Semantic UI dirancang dengan hierarki visual yang jelas dan terintegrasi dengan modul validasi JavaScript otomatis bawaan framework tanpa memerlukan library pihak ketiga.\n\n## 1. Anatomi Dasar Formulir (`ui form`)\n\nStruktur dasar satu formulir dibungkus di dalam tag `<form class=\"ui form\">`:\n\n```html\n<form class=\"ui form\">\n  <div class=\"field\">\n    <label>Nama Pengguna</label>\n    <input type=\"text\" name=\"username\" placeholder=\"Masukkan nama pengguna\">\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"field\">\n    <label>Kata Sandi</label>\n    <input type=\"password\" name=\"password\" placeholder=\"Minimal 8 karakter\">\n  </div>\n\n  <button class=\"ui primary button\" type=\"submit\">Daftar Akun</button>\n</form>\n```\n\n## 2. Pengelompokan Kolom Input (`fields`)\n\nUntuk menempatkan beberapa kolom input dalam satu baris horizontal:\n\n### A. Pembagian Berdasarkan Kata Jumlah (`two fields`, `three fields`)\n```html\n<div class=\"two fields\">\n  <div class=\"field\">\n    <label>Nama Depan</label>\n    <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Contoh: Aryanda\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"field\">\n    <label>Nama Belakang</label>\n    <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Contoh: Pratama\">\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n### B. Pembagian Kolom Bebas Rata (`equal width fields`)\n```html\n<div class=\"equal width fields\">\n  <div class=\"field\">\n    <label>Kota</label>\n    <input type=\"text\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"field\">\n    <label>Provinsi</label>\n    <input type=\"text\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"field\">\n    <label>Kode Pos</label>\n    <input type=\"text\">\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## 3. Variasi Input: Ikon, Label, dan Tombol Gandeng\n\n- **Input dengan Ikon (`icon input`)**:\n  ```html\n  <div class=\"ui left icon input\">\n    <i class=\"envelope icon\"></i>\n    <input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"nama@domain.com\">\n  </div>\n  ```\n- **Input dengan Label Prefix (`labeled input`)**:\n  ```html\n  <div class=\"ui right labeled input\">\n    <label class=\"ui label\">https://</label>\n    <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"nama-situs\">\n    <div class=\"ui basic label\">.id</div>\n  </div>\n  ```\n- **Input dengan Tombol Aksi Bersambung (`action input`)**:\n  ```html\n  <div class=\"ui action input\">\n    <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Masukkan kode kupon...\">\n    <button class=\"ui teal button\">Klaim</button>\n  </div>\n  ```\n\n## 4. Modul Validasi Formulir Otomatis Bawaan\n\nSalah satu fitur paling unggul dari Semantic UI adalah modul validasi formulir terpadu. Anda cukup mendeklarasikan aturan validasi dalam bentuk objek JavaScript:\n\n### Markup HTML Form dengan Wadah Error\n```html\n<form class=\"ui form\" id=\"formRegistrasi\">\n  <div class=\"field\">\n    <label>Nama Lengkap</label>\n    <input type=\"text\" name=\"nama\">\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"field\">\n    <label>Alamat Surel</label>\n    <input type=\"email\" name=\"email\">\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"field\">\n    <label>Kata Sandi</label>\n    <input type=\"password\" name=\"password\">\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"field\">\n    <div class=\"ui checkbox\">\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"syarat\">\n      <label>Saya menyetujui syarat & ketentuan layanan.</label>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Wadah Pesan Kesalahan Otomatis -->\n  <div class=\"ui error message\"></div>\n\n  <button class=\"ui primary button\" type=\"submit\">Daftarkan Sekarang</button>\n</form>\n```\n\n### Konfigurasi JavaScript Validasi\n```javascript\n$('#formRegistrasi').form({\n  on: 'blur', // Validasi saat pengguna berpindah input (blur) atau submit\n  fields: {\n    nama: {\n      identifier: 'nama',\n      rules: [\n        {\n          type: 'empty',\n          prompt: 'Nama lengkap wajib diisi.'\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    email: {\n      identifier: 'email',\n      rules: [\n        {\n          type: 'email',\n          prompt: 'Alamat surel tidak valid.'\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    password: {\n      identifier: 'password',\n      rules: [\n        {\n          type: 'minLength[8]',\n          prompt: 'Kata sandi minimal berisi 8 karakter.'\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    syarat: {\n      identifier: 'syarat',\n      rules: [\n        {\n          type: 'checked',\n          prompt: 'Anda harus menyetujui syarat dan ketentuan sebelum melanjutkan.'\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  onSuccess: function(event) {\n    event.preventDefault();\n    alert('Seluruh data formulir valid! Siap dikirim ke server.');\n  }\n});\n```\n\nKetika ada kolom yang tidak memenuhi aturan, Semantic UI akan otomatis:\n1. Menambahkan class `error` pada elemen `.field` yang bermasalah (memberikan warna merah pada garis batas dan label).\n2. Menampilkan daftar pesan kesalahan di dalam elemen `<div class=\"ui error message\"></div>`.\n\n---\nLanjutkan pembelajaran ke komponen views: [07. Tampilan Informasi Kompleks (Card, Feed, dan Statistic)](07.%20Tampilan%20Informasi%20Kompleks%20(Card,%20Feed,%20dan%20Statistic).md).\n","excerpt":"#programming","readingTime":3,"updated":null,"contentHash":"sha256:ec8ef5ae4da6dd2934a511f7c0b718cd3a5371848e9fb1e11c0dad9a582e4b47","outputPath":"Pemrograman/CSS/Semantic UI/06. Formulir dan Validasi Otomatis","breadcrumb":["Pemrograman","CSS","Semantic UI"],"links":[{"id":"pemrograman/css/semantic-ui/07.-tampilan-informasi-kompleks-(card,-feed,-dan-statistic)","title":"07. Tampilan Informasi Kompleks (Card, Feed, dan Statistic)","href":"/docs/pemrograman/css/semantic-ui/07.-tampilan-informasi-kompleks-(card,-feed,-dan-statistic)"}],"backlinks":[{"id":"pemrograman/css/semantic-ui/05_semantic-ui","title":"05_Semantic UI"},{"id":"pemrograman/css/semantic-ui/05.-koleksi-tata-letak-(menu,-message,-dan-table)","title":"05. Koleksi Tata Letak (Menu, Message, dan Table)"}],"brokenLinks":[],"html":"<p>Formulir di Semantic UI dirancang dengan hierarki visual yang jelas dan terintegrasi dengan modul validasi JavaScript otomatis bawaan framework tanpa memerlukan library pihak ketiga.</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-anatomi-dasar-formulir-ui-form\">1. Anatomi Dasar Formulir (<code>ui form</code>)</h2>\n<p>Struktur dasar satu formulir dibungkus di dalam tag <code>&#x3C;form class=\"ui form\"></code>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">form</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui form\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"field\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>Nama Pengguna<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"text\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"username\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">placeholder</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"Masukkan nama pengguna\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"field\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>Kata Sandi<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"password\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"password\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">placeholder</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"Minimal 8 karakter\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui primary button\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"submit\"</span>></span>Daftar Akun<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">form</span>></span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"2-pengelompokan-kolom-input-fields\">2. Pengelompokan Kolom Input (<code>fields</code>)</h2>\n<p>Untuk menempatkan beberapa kolom input dalam satu baris horizontal:</p>\n<h3 id=\"a-pembagian-berdasarkan-kata-jumlah-two-fields-three-fields\">A. Pembagian Berdasarkan Kata Jumlah (<code>two fields</code>, <code>three fields</code>)</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"two fields\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"field\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>Nama Depan<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"text\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">placeholder</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"Contoh: Aryanda\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"field\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>Nama Belakang<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"text\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">placeholder</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"Contoh: Pratama\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"b-pembagian-kolom-bebas-rata-equal-width-fields\">B. Pembagian Kolom Bebas Rata (<code>equal width fields</code>)</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"equal width fields\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"field\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>Kota<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"text\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"field\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>Provinsi<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"text\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"field\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>Kode Pos<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"text\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"3-variasi-input-ikon-label-dan-tombol-gandeng\">3. Variasi Input: Ikon, Label, dan Tombol Gandeng</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Input dengan Ikon (<code>icon input</code>)</strong>:\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui left icon input\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">i</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"envelope icon\"</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">i</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"email\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">placeholder</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"nama@domain.com\"</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n</code></pre>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Input dengan Label Prefix (<code>labeled input</code>)</strong>:\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui right labeled input\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui label\"</span>></span>https://<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"text\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">placeholder</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"nama-situs\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui basic label\"</span>></span>.id<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n</code></pre>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Input dengan Tombol Aksi Bersambung (<code>action input</code>)</strong>:\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui action input\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"text\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">placeholder</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"Masukkan kode kupon...\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui teal button\"</span>></span>Klaim<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n</code></pre>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"4-modul-validasi-formulir-otomatis-bawaan\">4. Modul Validasi Formulir Otomatis Bawaan</h2>\n<p>Salah satu fitur paling unggul dari Semantic UI adalah modul validasi formulir terpadu. Anda cukup mendeklarasikan aturan validasi dalam bentuk objek JavaScript:</p>\n<h3 id=\"markup-html-form-dengan-wadah-error\">Markup HTML Form dengan Wadah Error</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">form</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui form\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"formRegistrasi\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"field\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>Nama Lengkap<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"text\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"nama\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"field\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>Alamat Surel<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"email\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"email\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"field\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>Kata Sandi<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"password\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"password\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"field\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui checkbox\"</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"checkbox\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"syarat\"</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>Saya menyetujui syarat &#x26; ketentuan layanan.<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&#x3C;!-- Wadah Pesan Kesalahan Otomatis --></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui error message\"</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui primary button\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"submit\"</span>></span>Daftarkan Sekarang<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">form</span>></span>\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"konfigurasi-javascript-validasi\">Konfigurasi JavaScript Validasi</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-javascript\">$(<span class=\"hljs-string\">'#formRegistrasi'</span>).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">form</span>({\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">on</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">'blur'</span>, <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Validasi saat pengguna berpindah input (blur) atau submit</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">fields</span>: {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">nama</span>: {\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">identifier</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">'nama'</span>,\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">rules</span>: [\n        {\n          <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">'empty'</span>,\n          <span class=\"hljs-attr\">prompt</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">'Nama lengkap wajib diisi.'</span>\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">email</span>: {\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">identifier</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">'email'</span>,\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">rules</span>: [\n        {\n          <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">'email'</span>,\n          <span class=\"hljs-attr\">prompt</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">'Alamat surel tidak valid.'</span>\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">password</span>: {\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">identifier</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">'password'</span>,\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">rules</span>: [\n        {\n          <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">'minLength[8]'</span>,\n          <span class=\"hljs-attr\">prompt</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">'Kata sandi minimal berisi 8 karakter.'</span>\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">syarat</span>: {\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">identifier</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">'syarat'</span>,\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">rules</span>: [\n        {\n          <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">'checked'</span>,\n          <span class=\"hljs-attr\">prompt</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">'Anda harus menyetujui syarat dan ketentuan sebelum melanjutkan.'</span>\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">onSuccess</span>: <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">event</span>) {\n    event.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">preventDefault</span>();\n    <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">alert</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">'Seluruh data formulir valid! Siap dikirim ke server.'</span>);\n  }\n});\n</code></pre>\n<p>Ketika ada kolom yang tidak memenuhi aturan, Semantic UI akan otomatis:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Menambahkan class <code>error</code> pada elemen <code>.field</code> yang bermasalah (memberikan warna merah pada garis batas dan label).</li>\n<li>Menampilkan daftar pesan kesalahan di dalam elemen <code>&#x3C;div class=\"ui error message\">&#x3C;/div></code>.</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<p>Lanjutkan pembelajaran ke komponen views: <a href=\"/docs/pemrograman/css/semantic-ui/07.-tampilan-informasi-kompleks-(card,-feed,-dan-statistic)\">07. Tampilan Informasi Kompleks (Card, Feed, dan Statistic)</a>.</p>","previous":"pemrograman/css/semantic-ui/05.-koleksi-tata-letak-(menu,-message,-dan-table)","next":"pemrograman/css/semantic-ui/07.-tampilan-informasi-kompleks-(card,-feed,-dan-statistic)"}